  "body": "**Blocked by:** none\n**Model tier:** low\n\n## Context\n\nModel tier rationale: This is a comment correction at one existing SQL contract, with no executable behavior change.\n\n- PR #1132, finding `c9d7699c83`, `backend/packages/data/src/manifest/moduleRegistryDriftCheck.ts:47`: The deduplication comment calls the stored column tenant even though the index uses tenant_id.\n\n## Task\n\nCorrect only the deduplication tuple in the `createModuleRegistryDriftCheckAction` documentation to the actual SQL column names `(tenant_id, kind, dedupe_key)`. Preserve the documented deduplication behavior and all executable code.\n\n## Touches\n\n- backend/packages/data/src/manifest/moduleRegistryDriftCheck.ts (deduplication tuple in the action comment only)\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\nThe inaccurate stored-column names in the reported tuple.\n\n### Out of scope\n\nAction behavior, SQL/index changes, broader comment rewriting and adjacent terminology cleanup.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- For finding `c9d7699c83`, the comment names `(tenant_id, kind, dedupe_key)`, matching the existing tenant-scoped partial unique index; the diff changes no executable statements.\n\n\n<!-- crb-followup:v1 pr=1132 key=c9d7699c83 -->",
